{"id":"nosotras","lemma":"nosotras","pos":"pron","rank":1033,"glosses":["we (feminine plural)"],"ipa":"/noˈsotɾas/","forms":{"masculinePlural":"nosotros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nosotras.wav","formAudio":{"nosotros":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-nosotros.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Puedes ir con nosotras?","en":"Can you go with us?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44691","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Mi abuela vivía con nosotras.","en":"My grandmother lived with us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333649","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"grandmother"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Nosotras la vimos.","en":"We've seen her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1062297","words":[null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"}]},{"text":"Tenemos todo el sitio para nosotras.","en":"We have the whole place for ourselves.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"site, place"},{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"Nosotras estábamos acá primero.","en":"We were here first.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"first, first up"}]}]}